 Rankings, comparisons, and calculators for smarter decisions.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-AE\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#organization\"},\"potentialAction\":{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https://toptenuae.com/search?q={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":\"required name=search_term_string\"}},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"CollectionPage\",\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#homepage\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/\",\"name\":\"TopTenUAE - The Best of the UAE, Ranked\",\"description\":\"Discover trending products, expert reviews, and free UAE tools including VAT and gratuity calculators.\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#website\"},\"about\":{\"@type\":\"Thing\",\"name\":\"UAE Product Reviews and Comparisons\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#organization\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-AE\",\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/images/brand/og-default.png\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":630}},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"HowTo\",\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com#howto\",\"name\":\"How to Clean Your Washing Machine in the UAE: The 2026 Maintenance Guide\",\"description\":\"Updated for 2026: Hard water and humidity in the UAE can ruin your machine. Here is the essential maintenance routine to banish odours and limescale for good.\",\"image\":[\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/b4df67ed4b0c518cefdd76d7611f2be3d0d76517-1200x675.webp\"],\"totalTime\":\"PT15M\",\"estimatedCost\":{\"@type\":\"MonetaryAmount\",\"currency\":\"AED\",\"value\":\"0\"},\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Read Full Guide\",\"text\":\"Updated for 2026: Hard water and humidity in the UAE can ruin your machine. Here is the essential maintenance routine to banish odours and limescale for good.\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com\"}],\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#organization\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#webpage\"}},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the best natural cleaner for a smelly washing machine?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The vinegar and baking soda combination is most effective. The acetic acid in vinegar dissolves hard water limescale, while baking soda deodorizes. Use them in a hot cycle for maximum impact.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"I see black mould on the rubber seal. How do I remove it?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"For persistent mould, use a diluted bleach solution (1 part bleach to 10 parts water). Apply to the mouldy areas with a cloth, wear gloves, ensure strong ventilation, and rinse thoroughly. Never mix bleach with vinegar.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How does UAE hard water damage my machine?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Hard water contains calcium and magnesium. When heated, these minerals form limescale that coats the internal heater element, reducing efficiency and increasing energy bills. It can also clog pipes and valves.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How often should I clean the drain pump filter?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Clean it every 3-6 months. This filter catches sand, lint, coins, and hair. In the UAE, fine sand significantly contributes to clogs and bad odours.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are commercial washing machine cleaners worth it?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, as a quarterly supplement. Look for Citric Acid-based cleaners for limescale or Oxygen Bleach-based cleaners for organic stains. Use them once every 3 months in place of your natural cleaning.\"}}]}]}20:[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2a\"}}],\"$L2b\"]\n22:null\n26